[profiles.guide]
notes = '''The right stick {rs} is a flick stick: push it to turn that way at once, then rotate it to keep turning. Gyro aims up, down and finely.
Gyro aims like the mouse. Hold {lb} and {rb} together to pause it while you reposition the controller, press {select} and {start} together to switch it off or on, and hold {l3} to recenter.
{west} interacts: pick up debris, use the sail, anchor and wheel, sleep. {south} jumps and swims up, hold {east} to crouch and to dive.
{rt} uses what's in your hand (hook, spear, rod, hammer); {lt} is the right-click, such as the hammer's build menu. Pick a piece with the right stick {rs}.
Building: {rb} rotates the piece, {up} removes the one you're looking at.
Hold {lb} for the hotbar and pick a slot with the right stick {rs}; {left} and {right} step through it. {down} drops the item in hand.
{north} opens the inventory, where the right stick {rs} moves the cursor and {rt} clicks. {l3} sprints (a toggle).
{select} lists the inventory, the notebook and chat. Naming a save or chatting: {guide} + {west} opens the on-screen keyboard.
The remove, drop and notebook keys are inferred: if they don't answer, check them in the game's Settings → Controls.'''

